  "job_B14.51_20251003_114318": {
    "text": "Be gri\u00f0e & be munde: Godes gri\u00f0 is ealra gri\u00f0a selast to geearnianne & geornost to healdanne & \u00fe\u00e6r\n\u00d0onne is rihtlic, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes cyricgri\u00f0 binnan wagum & Cristenes cyninges handgri\u00f0 stande efen\n& hwilum w\u00e6ran heafodstedas & healice hadas micelre m\u00e6\u00f0e & munde wyr\u00f0e & gri\u00f0ian mihton \u00fea, \u00fee\n& \u00feus hit stod on \u00f0am dagum inne mid Englum, \u00f0\u00e6t, gyf feorhscyldig man cyning gesohte, arcebiscop\n& gyf he gesohte leodbiscop o\u00f0\u00f0e ealdorman o\u00f0\u00f0on healicne heafodstede, \u00feonne ahte he VII nihta gri\u00f0,\n& on Cantwara lage cyning & arcebiscop agan gelicne and efen dyrne mundbryce.\n& on \u00feam lagum is arcebiscopes feoh endlyfangylde & cynges is nigongylde.\n& Christes cyrican mundbyrd is efne swa cynges.\n& on Su\u00f0engla lage gri\u00f0lagu \u00feus stent, \u00f0\u00e6t, gif hwa gefeohte\u00f0 on cyrican o\u00f0\u00f0on on cynges huse, \u00feonne\n& gif hwa gefeohte\u00f0 on mynstre butan cyrcean, gebete eall mid fulre bote \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6rto gebyrige be\n& gyf hwa cynges mundbrice elles gewyrce, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t mid V pundum on Engla lage, arcebiscopes &\n& gyf man beforan \u00e6\u00f0elinge o\u00f0\u00f0e arcebiscpe gefeoht agynne\u00f0, mid CL scillinga gebete; gyf beforan\n& on Nor\u00f0engla lage stent, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00f0e ofsleh\u00f0 man binnan cyricwagum, he bi\u00f0 feorhscyldig.\n& se \u00f0e gewunda\u00f0, se bi\u00f0 handscyldig.\n& se \u00fee man ofsleh\u00f0 binnan cyricderum, sylle \u00fe\u00e6re cyrican CXX scillinga be Nor\u00f0engla lage.\n& frigman se \u00f0e cwicne on \u00fe\u00e6re mundbyrde geyfelige, sylle XXX scillinga.\n& se \u00fee in cynges byrig o\u00f0\u00f0on on his neaweste feohte\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e stele\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 feorhscyldig, nim\u00fee se cyng\n& gyf forworht man fri\u00f0stol gesece & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t feorh geyrne, \u00feonne sy \u00fereora an for his feore, bute\n& beo \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fereora swylc hit beo gylde he, \u00feeowige he & \u00feolige he, finde borh, gyf he m\u00e6ge; & gyf he\n& gyf he \u00feyssa \u00e6nig aleoge, nahwar he eft his feorh gefare ne geyrne.\nH\u00e6lnesgri\u00f0 & hadgri\u00f0 healde man mid rihte \u00e6fre swy\u00fee georne & Godes lagum fylge & lareowum\nBiscpas syndan bydelas & Godes lage lareowas & hy scylan georne oft & gelome clypian to Christe\nSe \u00fee oferhogie \u00fe\u00e6t he heom hlyste, h\u00e6bbe him gem\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00f0 God sylfne.\nAc sume men syndan, \u00fee for heora prytan & eac for gebyrdan forhogia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hy hyran godcundan\nAc \u00fea ne beo\u00f0 na wise ne fullice gescade, \u00fee Gode nella\u00f0 hyran ne bet understandan, hu oft he of\nWe witan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fer\u00e6l wear\u00f0 to \u00f0egene & ceorl wear\u00f0 to eorle, sangere to sacerde &\n& hwilum wear\u00f0 geworden, swa swa God wolde, sceaphyrde to cynge & se wear\u00f0 swy\u00fee m\u00e6re; eac\nSwilce syndan Godes gyfa, \u00fee ea\u00fee m\u00e6g of lytlan ar\u00e6ran to miclan eall \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf wile, eal swa se\nSwylc understanda\u00f0 \u00fea \u00f0e Godes ege habba\u00f0 & wisdomes gyma\u00f0.\n& wise eac w\u00e6ron on geardagum woroldwitan, \u00fee \u00e6rest gesettan to godcundan rihtlagan woroldlaga\n& on hwam m\u00e6g huru \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man on worolde swy\u00f0or God wur\u00f0ian \u00feonne on cyrcan & on\n& la, hwilcan ge\u00feance m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man \u00e6fre huru\u00feinga \u00fe\u00e6t don, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine on cyrican georne gebidd\u00e6\nO\u00f0\u00f0on hwilcan ge\u00feance m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man \u00e6fre ge\u00feencan on his mode, \u00fe\u00e6t he to sacerdan heafod ahylde\nAc haligdom & hadas & gehalgode Godes hus a man sceal for Godes ege weor\u00f0ian georne & inwerdre\n& eac is mycel nyd\u00feearf manna gehwylcum, \u00fe\u00e6t he o\u00f0rum beode \u00fe\u00e6t riht, \u00fe\u00e6t he wille \u00fe\u00e6t man him\nEalle we habba\u00f0 \u00e6nne heofonlicne f\u00e6der & ane gastlice modor, seo is ecclesia genamod, \u00fe\u00e6t is Godes\n& \u00feonne is rihtlic eac, \u00fe\u00e6t ure \u00e6lce o\u00f0erne healde mid rihte, & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc cyrice sy \u00e6fre on Godes\nFor\u00f0am \u00e6lc cyricgri\u00f0 is Cristenes agen gri\u00f0; & \u00e6lc Cristen man ah micle \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00f0am gri\u00f0e",
